{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"idle\">\n  <state id=\"idle\">\n    <transition event=\"start\" target=\"running\"/>\n  </state>\n  <state id=\"running\">\n    <transition event=\"stop\" target=\"idle\"/>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-truncated-nested-elements.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-truncated-nested-elements.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":224,"endColumn":45,"endLine":6,"startColumn":45,"startLine":6},"insertedContent":{"text":"\n</state>\n</scxml>"}}]}],"description":{"text":"add `</state></scxml>` at the end of the document"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-truncated-nested-elements.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":45,"endLine":6,"startColumn":44,"startLine":6}}}],"message":{"markdown":"the document ends before `<state>`, `<scxml>` are closed\n\n**Note:** SCXML documents must be well-formed XML 1.0 with namespaces; no later validation runs until parsing succeeds\n\n**Help:** add `</state></scxml>` at the end of the document; if the document was cut off, restore the missing content first\n\n**Spec:** XML 1.0 (Fifth Edition) §2.1 Well-Formed XML Documents","text":"the document ends before `<state>`, `<scxml>` are closed"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":224,"start":223},"category":"syntax"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"`<state>` opens here and is never closed"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-truncated-nested-elements.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":9,"endLine":5,"startColumn":4,"startLine":5}}}],"ruleId":"XML001"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML is an XML vocabulary; until the document parses, no schema or semantic rule can run"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: fix the XML syntax at the marked position: remove Markdown code fences or prose outside the single root element, keep `<?xml …?>` at the very start, escape `<` as `&lt;` and `&` as `&amp;` in attribute values and text (or use `<![CDATA[ … ]]>` in `<script>`), close or rename mismatched tags, quote attribute values, specify each attribute once, and never write `--` inside a comment.\n\nSpecification: XML 1.0 (Fifth Edition) §2.1 Well-Formed XML Documents\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain XML001` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#sec-well-formed","id":"XML001","name":"XML001","properties":{"category":"syntax"},"shortDescription":{"text":"the document is not well-formed XML"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}